<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  MasterClock — es

  Mode names (Timer, Fischer, Move) are Kotlin literals, not resources, so they stay in English by
  construction — see the note in values/strings.xml.

  Translated without a native reviewer, unlike the French files. Wording is the part to check first
  if a Spanish speaker reads this; the placeholders and plural categories were verified mechanically.
-->
